 "about": "Vectors for the return after an agreement (legal-context-return.md): the Legal-Context header, an RFC 9651 Item whose token is H's LCP string and whose one parameter is rv, the sale's 32-byte return value as a byte sequence; and the member by which an agreement option names the charge options it serves. H is mpp-challenge.json's; the return value is the bytes 0x00 to 0x1f; the x402 option and the MPP challenge are mpp-challenge.json's C_E and the x402 specification's example option. Expected values were written from the profile with Python 3.12.3's base64 and json, the MPP opaque as base64url without padding of RFC 8785's form.",
